flowchart TD
    subgraph origin[Origin node - current behavior]
        call[Guest CRDT host call] --> validate[Validate input]
        validate --> reserve[Reserve bounded queue space]
        reserve --> update[Create OpId and compute updated CRDT state]
        update --> persist[Atomic batch: CRDT state, materialized value, seen ID, and replay op log]
        persist --> flush[Confirm store flush]
        flush --> publish[Publish state in memory]
        publish --> enqueue[Enqueue accepted operation]
    end
    subgraph receiver[Receiving node - current behavior]
        check{OpId already seen?}
        check -->|Yes| ignore[Skip duplicate]
        check -->|No| plan[Plan CRDT update]
        plan --> persistRemote[Persist state, seen ID, and op-log batch]
        persistRemote --> publishRemote[Publish state in memory]
    end
    enqueue --> batch[Broadcast loop drains and batches accepted operations]
    batch --> push[PushOps to connected peers]
    push --> check
